# Private denylist — copy to `.private-denylist` (gitignored) and fill in.
#
# One regex alternation per line. Blank lines and # comments ignored.
# These names must never appear in a public skill, and must never appear
# in this repo either — which is why the real file is not committed.
#
# Client and employer names, including former ones:
# Acme|AcmeCorp
#
# Real people — founders, staff, customers quoted in examples. This is the
# category that actually gets through, because a person's name rarely
# co-occurs with the company's.
# Jane ?Doe|Doe
#
# Vendors and internal tooling that reveal the stack:
# SomeHost|SomeCRM
